MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1089224576}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6dceda630fe6f074c8c081b3e596a3c6, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NPCTalker
  text:
  - Want to know how to play? You've come to the right place
  - You can move around with the Left Joystick. Click it in to sprint!
  - Lock-on to enemies by pressing LB. You will automatically aim towards the nearest
    target.
  - Use the right bumper and trigger to perform light and heavy attacks, respectively.
  - Use LT to interact with objects like dropped items and switches.
  - You may need to attack some objects with your weapons to open doors.
  - Press START to open the menu. In the menu, you can equip and use items you pick
    up, and you can monitor...
  - ...your power levels and other statistics.
  - The menu is navigated using the + Control Pad. You can still walk with the left
    stick when the menu is open.
  - These are not used interchangably in this game, so please be careful.
  - One more thing. We humbly request that you do not attempt to ride the elevator
    with your weapons equipped.
  - It can damage the elevator, and repairs cost considerable money. (Weapons will
    be dequipped when going to your selected level)
